{
 "_note": "common: files under Common Props instead of the room's department. roles: crew behaviour hooks. not_default: in the tray but not placed by default (drone bays keep their live dock and drone). live_anchors: the live drone (_rov) and dock (_hatch) take the painted pad's position; sizes are the views' prop rects. floor_pieces: flat floor art (hatches, pads): drawn under crew, no collision, no shadow. floor_splits: prop whose rug installs as <id>-rug (model_cut floor_split), placed with it. collision_boxes: per-prop override, fractions of the region. live_obstacles: {room: {quarter: [[x,y,w,h]]}} live machinery (airlock pressure chamber, cryo pods) that painted props are placed clear of. live_anchors size may carry a third value: sideways offset (pairs). clear_west: {id: px} free floor kept west of the prop (crew work the suit lockers facing east). effects: {id: [{kind: specimen_glow|field, area: [fx,fy,fw,fh] of the art, color, strength?}]} drawn while the room is powered. screens_add: {id: [[x,y,w,h]]} monitor glass the detector misses (angled side screens), in the prop's pixels. effects kind hologram: area is the emitter lens; a wireframe globe hangs above it. screens_drop: {id: [[x,y,w,h]]} detected dark glass that is not a monitor (solar cells, viewports, rack windows with painted lights).",
